{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"세 수의 평균","desc":"<p>세 수의 평균을 <b>소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림</b>해 돌려주는 <code>average3(a, b, c)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def average3(a, b, c):\n    pass\n","solution":"def average3(a, b, c):\n    return round((a + b + c) / 3, 2)\n","hint":"<p><code>round(값, 자릿수)</code> 로 반올림해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"average3(1, 2, 3)","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"average3(1, 2, 4)","expected":2.33,"visible":true},{"call":"average3(10, 20, 25)","expected":18.33,"visible":false},{"call":"average3(0, 0, 1)","expected":0.33,"visible":false},{"call":"average3(5, 5, 5)","expected":5,"visible":false}],"id":"py-027"}